I think over the course of the past couple of weeks, I have fallen into the trap of "Disguised Productivity"

Where you feel like you're making meaningful progress, but majority of the times you're just wasting time

Waking up → hanging out w/ work friends → socialising all day long → not "working"

I know i've made good "progress" over the couple of weeks I've been here, but I don't know

I haven't shipped anything per se, and I feel so guily about it

I just want to escape
